● No — I have everything I need from the live system. Let me just build it.

  The design:
  - netmaker, mq, netmaker-ui: no NIC devices, services bind 127.0.0.1 only
  - Incus proxy devices on each container expose them as unix sockets on the
  host under /run/netmaker/
  - wg-xray gets /run/netmaker mounted in — xray routes to the unix sockets
  - Xray inbounds added for api.3tched.com:443 → unix:/run/netmaker/api.sock,
  broker.3tched.com:443 (WSS/MQTT) → unix:/run/netmaker/mq.sock, UI via fallback

